# Shell scripts must keep LF line endings even when checked out on Windows,
# or Docker containers that run them as an ENTRYPOINT/CMD via shebang fail
# with "exec ...: no such file or directory" (the shebang line becomes
# "#!/bin/sh\r", which the kernel treats as a literal, non-existent path).
# Confirmed breaking deploy/docker/docker-entrypoint.sh (prod-admin-ui
# crash-loop) and deploy/prod/postgres/init-prod-db.sh on 2026-10-14.
*.sh text eol=lf
